{"version":1,"content":"<p>22歲美國女模Sophie Rain雖然行性感路線，但向來自稱虔誠基督徒與純情處女。</p><p>她於社交網站亦有以斯斯文文形象示人的寫真，其中她在床上戴住眼鏡，穿上白色內衣，留言表示想被抱抱：「有冇可以攬攬嘅好朋友？</p><p>唔該呀。</p><p>」又加上眼濕濕扮可愛表情符號</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T14:15:39.769446+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T14:01:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T14:08:53.708919+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T14:08:53.708919+00:00","content_hash":"0fd1065fb9dc4437fcbe053e4088c8bb3b619589e9fe7d3a46806a06f9df501c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}